WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
[cheerful orchestral music]

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.000
NARRATOR: Almost every town
has a railroad station.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Some are larger than others,

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.600
but all railroad stations, large or small,
are very interesting places.

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:13.400
[music continues]

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:18.300
For example, at most railroad stations
you will usually find the Railway Express.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:21.100
[music]

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:25.700
You will see people checking and sorting packages
to make certain that they will be put aboard

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:28.700
trains which will take them
to their destinations without delay.

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:30.000
[music fades]
